{
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A hundred-dollar shoe can flip for a thousand.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 3.0
  },
  {
   "text": "That ain't luck. That's the sneaker game, by design.",
   "start": 3.25,
   "end": 6.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Let me break down how the hype gets made.",
   "start": 6.6,
   "end": 9.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Step one: the story. 1985, the Air Jordan 1.",
   "start": 9.35,
   "end": 13.325
  },
  {
   "text": "Nike bet on a rookie. Now Jordan's a whole brand.",
   "start": 13.575,
   "end": 16.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Step two: the culture. Run-DMC dropped \"My Adidas.\"",
   "start": 17.1,
   "end": 20.95
  },
  {
   "text": "That song helped land a deal. Rap and kicks, locked in.",
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 24.775
  },
  {
   "text": "Step three: scarcity. Make fewer pairs than people want.",
   "start": 25.025,
   "end": 28.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Drop day hits. Raffles, apps, and bots, all racing.",
   "start": 28.95,
   "end": 32.425
  },
  {
   "text": "Step four: resale. Miss the drop? Pay the market.",
   "start": 32.675,
   "end": 35.675
  },
  {
   "text": "StockX checks the pair is real, then takes a cut.",
   "start": 35.925,
   "end": 39.175
  },
  {
   "text": "You might be thinking: it's just shoes.",
   "start": 39.425,
   "end": 41.625
  },
  {
   "text": "Nah. It's status you can lace up.",
   "start": 41.875,
   "end": 44.075
  },
  {
   "text": "Or: resale is a bubble.",
   "start": 44.325,
   "end": 46.225
  },
  {
   "text": "Cowen projected resale could hit $30 billion by 2030.",
   "start": 46.475,
   "end": 50.975
  },
  {
   "text": "So the real product? Not the shoe. It's the wait.",
   "start": 51.225,
   "end": 53.975
  },
  {
   "text": "Comment KICKS and I'll send my drop-day checklist.",
   "start": 54.225,
   "end": 57.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this so you can come back to it.",
   "start": 58.1,
   "end": 60.3
  }
